<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" xml:lang="en" lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="generator" content="Docutils 0.23: https://docutils.sourceforge.io/" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Math as HTML with a linked stylesheet</title>

</head>
<body>
<main id="math-as-html-with-a-linked-stylesheet">
<h1 class="title">Math as HTML with a linked stylesheet</h1>

<p>With <span class="docutils literal">embed_stylesheet</span> off, <span class="docutils literal">math.css</span> is linked:
<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <mfrac>
    <mi>a</mi>
    <mi>b</mi>
  </mfrac>
</math> and</p>
<div>
<math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block">
  <mrow>
    <mo>(</mo>
    <mtable>
      <mtr>
        <mtd>
          <mi>a</mi>
        </mtd>
      </mtr>
      <mtr>
        <mtd>
          <mi>b</mi>
        </mtd>
      </mtr>
    </mtable>
    <mo>)</mo>
  </mrow>
</math>
</div>
</main>
</body>
</html>
